{
  "mailer_subjects_confirmation": "Confirme seu cadastro na Nobre Burger 🍔",
  "mailer_templates_confirmation_content": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"pt-BR\">\n<head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Bem-vindo! Confirme seu e-mail</title></head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f1ec;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1f2937\">\n<span style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0\">Falta só um clique para ativar sua conta.</span>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background:#f4f1ec;padding:24px 12px\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.08)\">\n  <tr><td style=\"background:#0d0f15;padding:24px;text-align:center\">\n    <img src=\"https://tomsilvaconsignado-ai.github.io/hamburqueria/icons/icon-192.png\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" alt=\"\" style=\"border-radius:14px;display:inline-block\">\n    <div style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:2px;color:#ffffff;margin-top:8px\">NOBRE BURGER</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:11px;letter-spacing:3px;color:#f59e0b;font-weight:bold\">HAMBÚRGUER ARTESANAL</div>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"height:5px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f59e0b,#f97316,#dc2626);background-color:#f97316\"></td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:28px 28px 8px\">\n    <h1 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:22px;color:#111827\">Bem-vindo! Confirme seu e-mail</h1>\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#374151\">Que bom ter você por aqui! Toque no botão para ativar sua conta na <strong>Nobre Burger</strong> e acompanhar seus pedidos, salvar endereço e pedir mais rápido.</p>\n    <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:4px 0 20px\">\n      <a href=\"{{ .ConfirmationURL }}\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#dc2626;background-image:linear-gradient(90deg,#ea580c,#dc2626);color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;font-size:15px;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:14px\">Confirmar meu e-mail</a>\n    </td></tr></table>\n    \n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#374151;background:#fff7ed;border-left:4px solid #f59e0b;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px\">O link vale por 1 hora.</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#6b7280\">Se o botão não abrir, copie e cole este endereço no navegador:<br><a href=\"{{ .ConfirmationURL }}\" style=\"color:#ea580c;word-break:break-all\">{{ .ConfirmationURL }}</a></p>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:16px 28px 28px\">\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#9ca3af\">Não foi você? Pode ignorar este e-mail com segurança: nada muda na sua conta.</p>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"background:#0d0f15;padding:18px;text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#9ca3af\">\n    🍔 <strong style=\"color:#ffffff\">Nobre Burger</strong> · Aracaju · SE<br>\n    <a href=\"https://tomsilvaconsignado-ai.github.io/hamburqueria/\" style=\"color:#f59e0b;text-decoration:none\">Fazer um pedido</a>\n  </td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
  "mailer_subjects_recovery": "Redefina sua senha · Nobre Burger",
  "mailer_templates_recovery_content": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"pt-BR\">\n<head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Vamos criar uma senha nova?</title></head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f1ec;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1f2937\">\n<span style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0\">Crie uma senha nova em poucos segundos.</span>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background:#f4f1ec;padding:24px 12px\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.08)\">\n  <tr><td style=\"background:#0d0f15;padding:24px;text-align:center\">\n    <img src=\"https://tomsilvaconsignado-ai.github.io/hamburqueria/icons/icon-192.png\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" alt=\"\" style=\"border-radius:14px;display:inline-block\">\n    <div style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:2px;color:#ffffff;margin-top:8px\">NOBRE BURGER</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:11px;letter-spacing:3px;color:#f59e0b;font-weight:bold\">HAMBÚRGUER ARTESANAL</div>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"height:5px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f59e0b,#f97316,#dc2626);background-color:#f97316\"></td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:28px 28px 8px\">\n    <h1 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:22px;color:#111827\">Vamos criar uma senha nova?</h1>\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#374151\">Recebemos um pedido para redefinir a senha da sua conta. Toque no botão e escolha a senha nova.</p>\n    <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:4px 0 20px\">\n      <a href=\"{{ .ConfirmationURL }}\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#dc2626;background-image:linear-gradient(90deg,#ea580c,#dc2626);color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;font-size:15px;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:14px\">Criar senha nova</a>\n    </td></tr></table>\n    \n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#374151;background:#fff7ed;border-left:4px solid #f59e0b;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px\">O link vale por 1 hora e só pode ser usado uma vez.</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#6b7280\">Se o botão não abrir, copie e cole este endereço no navegador:<br><a href=\"{{ .ConfirmationURL }}\" style=\"color:#ea580c;word-break:break-all\">{{ .ConfirmationURL }}</a></p>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:16px 28px 28px\">\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#9ca3af\">Não foi você? Pode ignorar este e-mail com segurança: nada muda na sua conta.</p>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"background:#0d0f15;padding:18px;text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#9ca3af\">\n    🍔 <strong style=\"color:#ffffff\">Nobre Burger</strong> · Aracaju · SE<br>\n    <a href=\"https://tomsilvaconsignado-ai.github.io/hamburqueria/\" style=\"color:#f59e0b;text-decoration:none\">Fazer um pedido</a>\n  </td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
  "mailer_subjects_magic_link": "Seu link de acesso · Nobre Burger",
  "mailer_templates_magic_link_content": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"pt-BR\">\n<head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Seu link de acesso</title></head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f1ec;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1f2937\">\n<span style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0\">Entre na sua conta com um toque.</span>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background:#f4f1ec;padding:24px 12px\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.08)\">\n  <tr><td style=\"background:#0d0f15;padding:24px;text-align:center\">\n    <img src=\"https://tomsilvaconsignado-ai.github.io/hamburqueria/icons/icon-192.png\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" alt=\"\" style=\"border-radius:14px;display:inline-block\">\n    <div style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:2px;color:#ffffff;margin-top:8px\">NOBRE BURGER</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:11px;letter-spacing:3px;color:#f59e0b;font-weight:bold\">HAMBÚRGUER ARTESANAL</div>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"height:5px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f59e0b,#f97316,#dc2626);background-color:#f97316\"></td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:28px 28px 8px\">\n    <h1 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:22px;color:#111827\">Seu link de acesso</h1>\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#374151\">Toque no botão para entrar na sua conta, sem precisar de senha.</p>\n    <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:4px 0 20px\">\n      <a href=\"{{ .ConfirmationURL }}\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#dc2626;background-image:linear-gradient(90deg,#ea580c,#dc2626);color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;font-size:15px;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:14px\">Entrar na minha conta</a>\n    </td></tr></table>\n    \n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#374151;background:#fff7ed;border-left:4px solid #f59e0b;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px\">O link vale por 1 hora e só pode ser usado uma vez.</p>\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#6b7280\">Se o botão não abrir, copie e cole este endereço no navegador:<br><a href=\"{{ .ConfirmationURL }}\" style=\"color:#ea580c;word-break:break-all\">{{ .ConfirmationURL }}</a></p>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:16px 28px 28px\">\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#9ca3af\">Não foi você? Pode ignorar este e-mail com segurança: nada muda na sua conta.</p>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"background:#0d0f15;padding:18px;text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#9ca3af\">\n    🍔 <strong style=\"color:#ffffff\">Nobre Burger</strong> · Aracaju · SE<br>\n    <a href=\"https://tomsilvaconsignado-ai.github.io/hamburqueria/\" style=\"color:#f59e0b;text-decoration:none\">Fazer um pedido</a>\n  </td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
  "mailer_subjects_invite": "Você foi convidado para a equipe da Nobre Burger",
  "mailer_templates_invite_content": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"pt-BR\">\n<head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Bem-vindo à equipe!</title></head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f1ec;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1f2937\">\n<span style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0\">Ative seu acesso ao painel da loja.</span>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background:#f4f1ec;padding:24px 12px\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.08)\">\n  <tr><td style=\"background:#0d0f15;padding:24px;text-align:center\">\n    <img src=\"https://tomsilvaconsignado-ai.github.io/hamburqueria/icons/icon-192.png\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" alt=\"\" style=\"border-radius:14px;display:inline-block\">\n    <div style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:2px;color:#ffffff;margin-top:8px\">NOBRE BURGER</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:11px;letter-spacing:3px;color:#f59e0b;font-weight:bold\">HAMBÚRGUER ARTESANAL</div>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"height:5px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f59e0b,#f97316,#dc2626);background-color:#f97316\"></td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:28px 28px 8px\">\n    <h1 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:22px;color:#111827\">Bem-vindo à equipe!</h1>\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#374151\">Você foi convidado para usar o sistema da <strong>Nobre Burger</strong> (painel, cozinha ou entregas). Toque no botão para ativar seu acesso e criar sua senha.</p>\n    <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:4px 0 20px\">\n      <a href=\"{{ .ConfirmationURL }}\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#dc2626;background-image:linear-gradient(90deg,#ea580c,#dc2626);color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;font-size:15px;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:14px\">Aceitar convite</a>\n    </td></tr></table>\n    \n    \n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#6b7280\">Se o botão não abrir, copie e cole este endereço no navegador:<br><a href=\"{{ .ConfirmationURL }}\" style=\"color:#ea580c;word-break:break-all\">{{ .ConfirmationURL }}</a></p>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:16px 28px 28px\">\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#9ca3af\">Não foi você? Pode ignorar este e-mail com segurança: nada muda na sua conta.</p>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"background:#0d0f15;padding:18px;text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#9ca3af\">\n    🍔 <strong style=\"color:#ffffff\">Nobre Burger</strong> · Aracaju · SE<br>\n    <a href=\"https://tomsilvaconsignado-ai.github.io/hamburqueria/\" style=\"color:#f59e0b;text-decoration:none\">Fazer um pedido</a>\n  </td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
  "mailer_subjects_email_change": "Confirme seu novo e-mail · Nobre Burger",
  "mailer_templates_email_change_content": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"pt-BR\">\n<head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Confirme seu novo e-mail</title></head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f1ec;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1f2937\">\n<span style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0\">Confirme a troca do e-mail da sua conta.</span>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background:#f4f1ec;padding:24px 12px\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.08)\">\n  <tr><td style=\"background:#0d0f15;padding:24px;text-align:center\">\n    <img src=\"https://tomsilvaconsignado-ai.github.io/hamburqueria/icons/icon-192.png\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" alt=\"\" style=\"border-radius:14px;display:inline-block\">\n    <div style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:2px;color:#ffffff;margin-top:8px\">NOBRE BURGER</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:11px;letter-spacing:3px;color:#f59e0b;font-weight:bold\">HAMBÚRGUER ARTESANAL</div>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"height:5px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f59e0b,#f97316,#dc2626);background-color:#f97316\"></td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:28px 28px 8px\">\n    <h1 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:22px;color:#111827\">Confirme seu novo e-mail</h1>\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#374151\">Recebemos um pedido para trocar o e-mail da sua conta de <strong>{{ .Email }}</strong> para <strong>{{ .NewEmail }}</strong>. Toque no botão para confirmar.</p>\n    <table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:4px 0 20px\">\n      <a href=\"{{ .ConfirmationURL }}\" style=\"display:inline-block;background:#dc2626;background-image:linear-gradient(90deg,#ea580c,#dc2626);color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold;font-size:15px;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:14px\">Confirmar novo e-mail</a>\n    </td></tr></table>\n    \n    \n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#6b7280\">Se o botão não abrir, copie e cole este endereço no navegador:<br><a href=\"{{ .ConfirmationURL }}\" style=\"color:#ea580c;word-break:break-all\">{{ .ConfirmationURL }}</a></p>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:16px 28px 28px\">\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#9ca3af\">Não foi você? Pode ignorar este e-mail com segurança: nada muda na sua conta.</p>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"background:#0d0f15;padding:18px;text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#9ca3af\">\n    🍔 <strong style=\"color:#ffffff\">Nobre Burger</strong> · Aracaju · SE<br>\n    <a href=\"https://tomsilvaconsignado-ai.github.io/hamburqueria/\" style=\"color:#f59e0b;text-decoration:none\">Fazer um pedido</a>\n  </td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
  "mailer_subjects_reauthentication": "{{ .Token }} é seu código de verificação · Nobre Burger",
  "mailer_templates_reauthentication_content": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"pt-BR\">\n<head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Seu código de verificação</title></head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f1ec;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1f2937\">\n<span style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0\">Seu código de verificação.</span>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background:#f4f1ec;padding:24px 12px\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.08)\">\n  <tr><td style=\"background:#0d0f15;padding:24px;text-align:center\">\n    <img src=\"https://tomsilvaconsignado-ai.github.io/hamburqueria/icons/icon-192.png\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" alt=\"\" style=\"border-radius:14px;display:inline-block\">\n    <div style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:2px;color:#ffffff;margin-top:8px\">NOBRE BURGER</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:11px;letter-spacing:3px;color:#f59e0b;font-weight:bold\">HAMBÚRGUER ARTESANAL</div>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"height:5px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f59e0b,#f97316,#dc2626);background-color:#f97316\"></td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:28px 28px 8px\">\n    <h1 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:22px;color:#111827\">Seu código de verificação</h1>\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#374151\">Use o código abaixo para confirmar que é você:</p>\n    \n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;text-align:center\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;font-size:30px;letter-spacing:8px;font-weight:900;color:#111827;background:#fff7ed;border:2px dashed #f59e0b;border-radius:14px;padding:12px 20px\">{{ .Token }}</span></p>\n    \n    \n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:16px 28px 28px\">\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#9ca3af\">Não foi você? Pode ignorar este e-mail com segurança: nada muda na sua conta.</p>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"background:#0d0f15;padding:18px;text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#9ca3af\">\n    🍔 <strong style=\"color:#ffffff\">Nobre Burger</strong> · Aracaju · SE<br>\n    <a href=\"https://tomsilvaconsignado-ai.github.io/hamburqueria/\" style=\"color:#f59e0b;text-decoration:none\">Fazer um pedido</a>\n  </td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
  "mailer_subjects_password_changed_notification": "Sua senha foi alterada · Nobre Burger",
  "mailer_templates_password_changed_notification_content": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"pt-BR\">\n<head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Sua senha foi alterada</title></head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f1ec;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1f2937\">\n<span style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0\">Sua senha foi alterada</span>\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"background:#f4f1ec;padding:24px 12px\">\n<tr><td align=\"center\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"max-width:520px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.08)\">\n  <tr><td style=\"background:#0d0f15;padding:24px;text-align:center\">\n    <img src=\"https://tomsilvaconsignado-ai.github.io/hamburqueria/icons/icon-192.png\" width=\"56\" height=\"56\" alt=\"\" style=\"border-radius:14px;display:inline-block\">\n    <div style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:2px;color:#ffffff;margin-top:8px\">NOBRE BURGER</div>\n    <div style=\"font-size:11px;letter-spacing:3px;color:#f59e0b;font-weight:bold\">HAMBÚRGUER ARTESANAL</div>\n  </td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"height:5px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f59e0b,#f97316,#dc2626);background-color:#f97316\"></td></tr>\n  <tr><td style=\"padding:28px 28px 8px\">\n    <h1 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:22px;color:#111827\">Sua senha foi alterada</h1>\n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:#374151\">A senha da sua conta (<strong>{{ .Email }}</strong>) acabou de ser alterada.</p>\n    \n    \n    <p style=\"margin:0 0 20px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#374151;background:#fff7ed;border-left:4px solid #f59e0b;padding:10px 12px;border-radius:8px\">Se não foi você, fale com a Nobre Burger ou troque sua senha em <a href=\"https://tomsilvaconsign